            <div xml:id="d707">

                <pb facs="0991" n="875" sameAs="frus:frus1923v01/pg875"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.60f 2/12: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">White</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-11-16T12:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                                1923—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 8:15 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>49. Your telegram number 39.<anchor n="8" xml:id="d707-f1"/> While agreement not
                    yet ratified by Parliament other formalities completed and it has been legally
                    effective since November 5th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
